[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5024381491","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121568#issuecomment-5024381491","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121568","id":5024381491,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABK3n6Mw","user":{"login":"theraot","id":1212509,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTI1MDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1212509?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/theraot","html_url":"https://github.com/theraot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theraot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theraot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theraot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theraot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theraot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theraot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theraot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theraot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theraot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-20T16:07:12Z","updated_at":"2026-07-20T16:07:12Z","body":"As you can observe Click with CTRL pressed unselects the node you intend you drag. That is, the code to unselect happens on the mouse button is pressed not when it is released. It should be possible to change that.\n\nMeanwhile, contrary to popular believe, you do not need to drag with CTRL pressed, you need to release with CTRL pressed. That is, CTRL is checked when you drop not when you start dragging, this way so you can change your mind during the drag. So you can workaround this by pressing CTRL before dropping instead of before dragging moment.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5024381491/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5180071516","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121568#issuecomment-5180071516","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121568","id":5180071516,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABNMGeXA","user":{"login":"romgerman","id":1517367,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MTczNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1517367?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman","html_url":"https://github.com/romgerman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-04T13:56:34Z","updated_at":"2026-08-04T13:56:34Z","body":"It seems that this is happening because deselecting nodes by using Ctrl works on mousedown and not on mouseup. So before you even start dragging, the node from which you are dragging gets deselected.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5180071516/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"ht